<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong>里花</strong>  <i>2001/02/09 09:22:31</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
<a href="noteky.cgi?c=notemenu&f=12&id=981678151vhqcas&id2=955383618harfyi&ff=on">APPEND 4</a></td></tr>
<tr bgcolor="#CCFFFF">
<td colspan="2">
私がＭＯＮＤＯ作品を好きなわけ：<BR>かわいくて、しかも健康的。<BR>だから、安心して見れるの。<BR>いつも安定して狂いのない線で描けるのも、「安心して見れる」理由。<BR>そうして、もうひとつ。<BR>「萌えどころ」を押さえてるんだも～ん♪
</td></tr>
</table></a><br>
<table border="0" width="100%">
<tr>
<td  bgcolor="#00FFCC"><strong><a href="mailto:Cww441il@hotmail.com" target="_blank">Paul C. Jensen</a></strong>  <i>2001/07/24 05:08:27</i><br></td>
<td bgcolor="#00CCFF" width="10%" align="center" nowrap>
<a href="noteky.cgi?c=notemenu&f=12&id=995918907ccojcw&id2=955383618harfyi&ff=on">APPEND 5</a></td></tr>
<tr bgcolor="#CCFFFF">
<td colspan="2">
I would like to see what happens to "HIM" when "SHE" catches up with "HIM"!!! Also MONDO's art work always brings a smile to my face... Keep up the good work MONDO !!!!!!! Is there a place that has all your work listed? And<BR>if so, where is it? Thank you for the funny art.<BR><BR>***********************************************************<BR><BR><BR> I am sorry that I only speak English. I hope this is not to hard to understand.
</td></tr>
</table></a><br>
